% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_Dir2013_34_Art30_Publication".

norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication is a substantive rule.

norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication has the label "Directive 2013/34/EU Article 30: Publication of financial statements".

norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication has the modality obligation.

norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication has the requirement type "http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/administrative-obligation/c_80214a02".

norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication has the legal text "Member States shall ensure that undertakings publish, within a period not exceeding 12 months after the balance sheet date, the duly approved annual financial statements and the management report.".

norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication produces action publish financial statements.

norm dir 2013 34 art 30 publication is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/oj/art_30/par_1".


% Things the description names but does not describe: their addresses.
action publish financial statements is identified by "http://example.org/Action_PublishFinancialStatements".


